  "_plan": "The shape of the place is the name of the place: two galleries wound round a shaft of live rock, with the gap in each wall put on the far side from the gap before it, so the way to the middle is two whole turns and the fire is on your hand the entire way. Nothing here is a maze -- the player can see the middle from the door and simply cannot reach it, which is a better lock than a door. Three resonance rings stand in the galleries; the Tideheart wakes them and the third opens the stair. Everything else on this map is a wall the player may choose to read.",
